// AWS ECR Container Image Pushed  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1525
// Detects pushing an image to ECR (PutImage). Adversaries implant backdoored images so that future deployments run their code.
// False positives: CI/CD pipelines pushing images. Scope to sensitive repositories or unusual principals.
// Source: rules/persistence/ecr-put-image.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^PutImage$/i eventSource=/^ecr\.amazonaws\.com$/i
